From 00aabbe5a252a2a53f5421da53d3889c27554d2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jared Baur <jaredbaur@fastmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:00:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] hwrng: rng90 - Add Microchip RNG90 driver

Add a driver for the Microchip RNG90, a standalone random number
generator with an I2C interface. The device combines a physical noise
source with a SHA-256 Hash_DRBG per NIST SP 800-90A/B/C and returns
32 bytes per Random command.

The quality is set to 512: per the datasheet, each 256-bit output of
the Random command carries a security strength of 128 bits.

Signed-off-by: Jared Baur <jaredbaur@fastmail.com>
